{
  "file": "hb33.jpg",
  "label": "33",
  "imageSha256": "88a7c1f0166a2059ff687b265c06e5a8d56924e5424da017d04e4e9c19fc284e",
  "left": 0.22813409666125306,
  "right": 0.7657691697040595,
  "rows": [
    {
      "text": "The school shall create a committee on decorum and",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.019225774332880974,
        "width": 0.3862214088439941,
        "x": 0.37375017549120054,
        "y": 0.30362899088120754
      },
      "level": 0.3118422145691314
    },
    {
      "text": "investigation of cases on sexual harassment. This committee shall",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02854972332715988,
        "width": 0.5339419841766357,
        "x": 0.22813409666125306,
        "y": 0.31735855478980857
      },
      "level": 0.3296920123808207
    },
    {
      "text": "comprise of a member of the administration, instructors/teachers",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.026338273659348488,
        "width": 0.5318355560302734,
        "x": 0.2301820440900153,
        "y": 0.3347785519922616
      },
      "level": 0.34294202789365047
    },
    {
      "text": "and students, as deemed appropriate. This committee shall",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02483217418193817,
        "width": 0.5299262603123982,
        "x": 0.2321074906220176,
        "y": 0.3489240224106651
      },
      "level": 0.36051644041857617
    },
    {
      "text": "investigate the alleged cases, constituting sexual harassment and",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02623019553720951,
        "width": 0.531890352567037,
        "x": 0.23017770797525175,
        "y": 0.3647564492853541
      },
      "level": 0.37450698375509606
    },
    {
      "text": "recommend to the school administration the appropriate actions",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02448679320514202,
        "width": 0.5336790084838867,
        "x": 0.2302347474783252,
        "y": 0.3802281114644228
      },
      "level": 0.38833897029233055
    },
    {
      "text": "based on the act.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.015988372266292572,
        "width": 0.1317829390366872,
        "x": 0.23255814147971843,
        "y": 0.4040697675550804
      },
      "level": 0.4041361282322324
    },
    {
      "text": "The offender, when found guilty shall be subject to the",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.023630686104297638,
        "width": 0.496761163075765,
        "x": 0.26713061106265235,
        "y": 0.425937318044199
      },
      "level": 0.4346142892354465
    },
    {
      "text": "penalties as prescribed in Section 7 of RA 7877, which includes fine",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.025729715824127197,
        "width": 0.5337682565053304,
        "x": 0.23207530506187313,
        "y": 0.4409937909308612
      },
      "level": 0.4495176878347001
    },
    {
      "text": "and imprisonment. Moreover, the offender shall be subject to",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.023937356658279896,
        "width": 0.5336865981419882,
        "x": 0.23214876172301757,
        "y": 0.45691021460492687
      },
      "level": 0.46579245379722517
    },
    {
      "text": "administrative sanctions as provided for in the administration",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.024742556735873222,
        "width": 0.5316982666651408,
        "x": 0.23407090303891875,
        "y": 0.4701785482774328
      },
      "level": 0.48118252842662623
    },
    {
      "text": "manual of the Laguna College.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.018393704667687416,
        "width": 0.2407878239949544,
        "x": 0.2342047473250446,
        "y": 0.49191659022035317
      },
      "level": 0.49482557924370696
    },
    {
      "text": "F. Provisions for Tobacco Regulation Act of 2003",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.018895348533988,
        "width": 0.43023256460825593,
        "x": 0.2558139448761047,
        "y": 0.5203488375244305
      },
      "level": 0.5207640352781547
    },
    {
      "text": "Based on R.A. No. 9211",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.016170058399438858,
        "width": 0.20542635520299274,
        "x": 0.2713178318623279,
        "y": 0.5390624997419439
      },
      "level": 0.5397102558175457
    },
    {
      "text": "As provided for in R.A. No. 9211, smoking is absolutely",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.020564589649438858,
        "width": 0.501937985420227,
        "x": 0.26937984951856864,
        "y": 0.5697674415201883
      },
      "level": 0.5703861278584983
    },
    {
      "text": "prohibited in schools or centers of youth activity. \"No Smoking\" signs",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02812235988676548,
        "width": 0.5377189715703328,
        "x": 0.23400305474700986,
        "y": 0.5812711270284614
      },
      "level": 0.5914934178510864
    },
    {
      "text": "are visible in conspicuous places in the school premises and shall",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02367641218006611,
        "width": 0.5393936634063721,
        "x": 0.23416821587200584,
        "y": 0.5989601725234226
      },
      "level": 0.6074720890711135
    },
    {
      "text": "be observed accordingly. Students who violate this policy shall be",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01904296875,
        "width": 0.5387596686681112,
        "x": 0.2344961413926884,
        "y": 0.6162109379576037
      },
      "level": 0.6163063686355859
    },
    {
      "text": "subject to the provisions on discipline of this handbook. Moreover,",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.022332409396767616,
        "width": 0.5411369403203328,
        "x": 0.2342343376158306,
        "y": 0.6306603467487186
      },
      "level": 0.6369443124229093
    },
    {
      "text": "minors who are caught selling, buying or smoking cigarettes or any",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.024909223429858685,
        "width": 0.5413555304209391,
        "x": 0.23419083028412047,
        "y": 0.6461351497045977
      },
      "level": 0.6543396159304395
    },
    {
      "text": "tobacco products shall be penalized under Article 189 of P.D. No.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02325281221419573,
        "width": 0.5449988842010498,
        "x": 0.2323237329916652,
        "y": 0.6624400846250373
      },
      "level": 0.6686921814245068
    },
    {
      "text": "603 The Child and Youth Welfare Code.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.01611328125,
        "width": 0.32170542081197107,
        "x": 0.23255813998161137,
        "y": 0.6831054690798066
      },
      "level": 0.683171829734487
    },
    {
      "text": "G. Provisions for Data Privacy Act based on R.A. 10173",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.020348837599158287,
        "width": 0.5135658979415894,
        "x": 0.23255813116486435,
        "y": 0.7122093022178626
      },
      "level": 0.7122756627402917
    },
    {
      "text": "The student's personal information shall be held in strictest",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.025417612865567207,
        "width": 0.5122788349787394,
        "x": 0.2690767268077978,
        "y": 0.7425063238259393
      },
      "level": 0.7506470975842657
    },
    {
      "text": "confidentiality. Only with the permission of the student shall",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02649252861738205,
        "width": 0.548999547958374,
        "x": 0.232357838779193,
        "y": 0.7600419820337323
      },
      "level": 0.7663868812275676
    },
    {
      "text": "information be provided to another party for legal purposes.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.018895348533988,
        "width": 0.47868216037750244,
        "x": 0.23255815060097737,
        "y": 0.780523255874721
      },
      "level": 0.780589616688692
    },
    {
      "text": "Minors who are represented by their parents or guardians must",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.02197265625,
        "width": 0.5155038833618164,
        "x": 0.26937984618730876,
        "y": 0.8095703121953421
      },
      "level": 0.8101889984836832
    },
    {
      "text": "co-sign request of document forms from the school.",
      "box": {
        "height": 0.015988372266292572,
        "width": 0.4147286812464396,
        "x": 0.23449612864034605,
        "y": 0.8299418603348769
      },
      "level": 0.8300372908215738
    },
    {
